{"seq":3,"slug":"file-checksum-total","title":"校验和、总笔数与总额核对","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/settlement-batch-file-exchange/file-parsing-validation/file-checksum-total","wordCount":2630,"readingTime":11,"html":"<h1 id=\"校验和-总笔数与总额核对\">校验和、总笔数与总额核对</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>控制记录核对是文件交换里最古老也最有效的质量控制手段，它的思想可以追溯到磁带时代的记账格式：文件头声明「本文件含 1284 笔、总金额 8,432,190.55 USD」，文件尾重复一次，接收方数一遍、加一遍、比一遍。这套机制的价值在于它是<strong>内容与声明的交叉验证</strong>——单看内容无法知道是否有行丢了（丢行后的内容仍然「看起来合法」），单看声明也无法知道声明本身是否可靠，但两者对比就能发现绝大多数截断、丢行、重复与拼接错误。</p>\n<p>三类核对目标的强度不同，必须分清。**校验和（checksum）**是对字节或行集合做的一个压缩映射，检出能力取决于算法：单一累加和只能检出单字节错误，CRC-32 能检出突发错误，SHA-256 能检出任何有意的修改。**总笔数（count）**是最强的控制记录之一，因为它是整数且语义明确——任何丢行、重复行、多行合并都会让它变化。**总额（total）**是最弱但业务上最重要的一项，因为金额计算涉及舍入、币种、方向，比较时必须严格对齐口径。</p>\n<p>一个关键的认识：<strong>控制记录的检查点在整个管道里有多个，但它们检查的是同一件事</strong>。文件层的哈希（<a href=\"../integration-file-format/file-sign-encrypt\">文件签名/加密/完整性校验</a>）检查字节完整性；文件内的控制记录检查逻辑内容完整性；解析后的行数与金额统计检查「我们理解的内容」完整性。三者必须<strong>独立计算并交叉比对</strong>，而不是用其中一个替代另一个。最常见的降级是用「行数对上了」来代替「总额对上了」——行数对但金额错的情况（一行的金额被截断成另一个合法数值）是完全存在的。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[文件头控制记录&lt;br/&gt;NbOfTxs / CtrlSum] --&gt; B[解析逐行]&#10;  B --&gt; C[实算行数 N_actual]&#10;  B --&gt; D[实算金额 S_actual&lt;br/&gt;按币种/方向分组]&#10;  C --&gt; E{header.N == N_actual?}&#10;  D --&gt; F{header.sum == S_actual?}&#10;  A2[文件尾控制记录&lt;br/&gt;trailer] --&gt; G{trailer 与 header 一致?}&#10;  E --&gt;|否| H[COUNT_MISMATCH&lt;br/&gt;整批不可信]&#10;  F --&gt;|否| I[TOTAL_MISMATCH&lt;br/&gt;拆解差额]&#10;  G --&gt;|否| J[TRAILER_HEADER_DIFF&lt;br/&gt;对方生成器缺陷]&#10;  I --&gt; K[差额归因]&#10;  K --&gt; L[隔离行合计&lt;br/&gt;可解释]&#10;  K --&gt; M[舍入差&lt;br/&gt;可解释, 需阈值]&#10;  K --&gt; N[未解释差额&lt;br/&gt;异常, 必须追责]&#10;  L --&gt; O[批次属性: 已知缺口]&#10;  M --&gt; O&#10;  N --&gt; P[隔离 + 告警 + 通知对方]\">graph TD\n  A[文件头控制记录&lt;br/&gt;NbOfTxs / CtrlSum] --&gt; B[解析逐行]\n  B --&gt; C[实算行数 N_actual]\n  B --&gt; D[实算金额 S_actual&lt;br/&gt;按币种/方向分组]\n  C --&gt; E{header.N == N_actual?}\n  D --&gt; F{header.sum == S_actual?}\n  A2[文件尾控制记录&lt;br/&gt;trailer] --&gt; G{trailer 与 header 一致?}\n  E --&gt;|否| H[COUNT_MISMATCH&lt;br/&gt;整批不可信]\n  F --&gt;|否| I[TOTAL_MISMATCH&lt;br/&gt;拆解差额]\n  G --&gt;|否| J[TRAILER_HEADER_DIFF&lt;br/&gt;对方生成器缺陷]\n  I --&gt; K[差额归因]\n  K --&gt; L[隔离行合计&lt;br/&gt;可解释]\n  K --&gt; M[舍入差&lt;br/&gt;可解释, 需阈值]\n  K --&gt; N[未解释差额&lt;br/&gt;异常, 必须追责]\n  L --&gt; O[批次属性: 已知缺口]\n  M --&gt; O\n  N --&gt; P[隔离 + 告警 + 通知对方]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>核对项</th>\n<th>检出对象</th>\n<th>计算代价</th>\n<th>处置强度</th>\n<th>常见误用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>字节哈希</td>\n<td>传输损坏、篡改、截断</td>\n<td>一遍 IO</td>\n<td>重传（或安全事件）</td>\n<td>用它替代内容核对</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>总笔数</td>\n<td>丢行、重复行、误合并</td>\n<td>一遍计数</td>\n<td>整批不可信，必须解决</td>\n<td>忽略「头尾不一致」独立信号</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>总金额（分组）</td>\n<td>金额错误、方向错误、币种混算</td>\n<td>一遍求和</td>\n<td>拆解差额后判定</td>\n<td>跨币种直接相加</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>借贷平衡</td>\n<td>分录方向错误、单边缺失</td>\n<td>一遍求和</td>\n<td>强信号（会计恒等式）</td>\n<td>与总额混为一谈</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>序号连续性</td>\n<td>批次缺失、乱序</td>\n<td>一遍扫描</td>\n<td>缺号即缺文件</td>\n<td>假设序号从 1 开始且连续</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"计算口径-分组是必须的\">计算口径：分组是必须的</h2><p>把整份文件的金额简单相加是一个常见但危险的简化。正确做法是<strong>按分组维度分别求和再逐组比对</strong>，理由是跨币种与跨方向的加总在数学上无意义，而且会把方向错误互相抵消。</p>\n<p>分组的维度至少有三个：<strong>币种</strong>（不同币种的金额不可直接相加，除非先按文件声明的汇率折算，而汇率口径的选取属于定价与货币领域，本篇只要求「先分组再求和」这个约束）、<strong>借贷方向</strong>（<code>CRDT</code> 与 <code>DBIT</code> 方向错误的行在简单加总时可能互相抵消而看不出来）、<strong>业务类型</strong>（清算、手续费、退款若分别声明总额，就必须分别核对）。</p>\n<p>一个等效的强检查是<strong>借贷平衡</strong>。若文件是分录形式的（每笔有方向），则全文件的借合计与贷合计应当相等：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mo>∑</mo><mo>∗</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>∈</mo><mtext>DBIT</mtext></mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>∑</mo><mo>∗</mo><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>∈</mo><mtext>CRDT</mtext></mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sum*{i \\in \\text{DBIT}} a_i = \\sum*{j \\in \\text{CRDT}} a_j</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.6em;vertical-align:-0.55em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∗</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">DBIT</span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.6em;vertical-align:-0.55em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∗</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CRDT</span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这个式子是会计恒等式在文件层的投影，它比总额核对更强——因为总额核对可以通过「借和贷同时错同一金额」而通过，借贷平衡则不能。当文件同时声明了总额与借贷两方合计时，应当三个数都核对，三者一致才认为内容自洽。</p>\n<p><strong>舍入差的处理</strong>必须显式化。当金额涉及汇率折算或费用计提时，逐行舍入后再求和不等于先求和再舍入，差异称为舍入差（rounding difference）：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mtext>round</mtext><mo>=</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>i</mi></munder><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">u</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">u</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.8em\" maxsize=\"1.8em\">(</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>i</mi></munder><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.8em\" maxsize=\"1.8em\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta\\_{\\text{round}} = \\sum_i \\mathrm{round}(a_i) - \\mathrm{round}\\Big(\\sum_i a_i\\Big)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0044em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">Δ_</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">round</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3277em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">round</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4277em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">round</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size2\">(</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size2\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 行的文件，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mtext>round</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta_{\\text{round}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">round</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的上界约为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mn>0.5</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mi>u</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n \\cdot 0.5 \\cdot u</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4445em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.5</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span></span></span></span></span>（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>u</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">u</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span></span></span></span></span> 是最小货币单位）。因此核对时应允许一个与行数成比例的容差：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>S</mi><mo>∗</mo><mtext>actual</mtext><mo>−</mo><mi>S</mi><mo>∗</mo><mtext>declared</mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>≤</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|S*{\\text{actual}} - S*{\\text{declared}}| \\le n \\cdot \\delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∗</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">actual</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∗</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">declared</span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4445em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span></span></span></span></span> 按币种的最小单位与约定的舍入规则设定。<strong>容差必须存在但不能用于掩盖真实差额</strong>——任何超过容差的差额都必须拆解归因，而不是把容差调大。这是这类核对最容易被滥用的地方：为了让告警消失而不断放大容差，最终使核对退化为形式。容差应当是有明确推导依据的常数（写清 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>u</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">u</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span></span></span></span></span> 与舍入规则），并在代码与配置里带上注释说明来源。</p>\n<h2 id=\"差额拆解-可解释与不可解释\">差额拆解：可解释与不可解释</h2><p>当总额不符时，处理方式不是「报错」，而是<strong>拆解差额</strong>。设声明总额为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>d</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S_d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、实算总额为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>a</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S_a</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，差额为</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>d</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>a</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D = S_d - S_a</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>把它分解为若干可解释项与一个残差：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>D</mi><mo>∗</mo><mtext>quarantine</mtext><mo>+</mo><mi>D</mi><mo>∗</mo><mtext>round</mtext><mo>+</mo><mi>D</mi><mo>∗</mo><mtext>dup</mtext><mo>+</mo><mi>D</mi><mo>∗</mo><mtext>other</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D = D*{\\text{quarantine}} + D*{\\text{round}} + D*{\\text{dup}} + D*{\\text{other}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∗</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8623em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">quarantine</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∗</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">round</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∗</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">dup</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∗</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">other</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>D</mi><mtext>quarantine</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D_{\\text{quarantine}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">quarantine</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>：被隔离行的金额合计。这是<strong>可解释</strong>的，且它是由我方规则导致的已知缺口（见 <a href=\"file-error-quarantine\">错误文件隔离与告警</a>）。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>D</mi><mtext>round</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D_{\\text{round}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">round</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>：舍入差，由上述容差模型界定。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>D</mi><mtext>dup</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D_{\\text{dup}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">dup</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>：重复行导致的差额。若文件内存在业务键重复的行（对方生成器缺陷），去重后的合计会小于声明合计。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>D</mi><mtext>other</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D_{\\text{other}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">other</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>：<strong>未解释差额</strong>。这是唯一真正需要追责的部分。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>这个恒等式的工程价值在于它让告警的措辞从「总额不符」变成「未解释差额 12,340.55 USD」，后者直接指向需要行动的量。更重要的是它要求系统<strong>能算出前三项</strong>，这反过来要求隔离记录、舍入模型与去重结果都是一等的数据结构，而不是临时日志。</p>\n<p>一个额外的高价值核对是<strong>序号连续性</strong>。很多文件带行序号或交易序号，检查其连续性可以立刻发现丢行：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>gap</mtext><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>∣</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mi>k</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\">∉</mo><mtext>Seq</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{gap} = \\{k \\mid k \\in [\\min, \\max],\\; k \\notin \\text{Seq}\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">gap</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7335em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mop\">min</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span></span><span class=\"mord vbox\"><span class=\"thinbox\"><span class=\"llap\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"inner\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\"></span></span></span><span class=\"fix\"></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Seq</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>发现 gap 时应当报「缺号区间」而不是「数量不符」，因为前者能直接定位到缺失位置。但要注意序号语义的不确定性——若序号不是从 1 开始、不是严格连续、或按业务类型分段编号，则连续性检查会产生假阳性。因此这项检查必须在接入约定里确认序号语义后才能启用，并作为<strong>配置项</strong>而非默认行为。</p>\n<h2 id=\"与对账中台的接口\">与对账中台的接口</h2><p>本 hub 的核对止于文件内部自洽；跨系统的比对（内部账、渠道账、银行流水的三方匹配）属于对账中台的职责。两者的接口有三个必须传递的信息：</p>\n<p><strong>批次可信度</strong>：批次不是简单的「通过/不通过」，而是一个带属性的对象——控制记录是否平衡、隔离行数与金额、未解释差额、容差适用情况。下游需要这些属性来区分「差异」与「已知缺口」。</p>\n<p><strong>账期归属</strong>：文件声明的账期可能与到达日不同（补传与修正版尤其如此，见 <a href=\"../batch-file-pipeline/batch-idempotent\">批次幂等与重复文件防护</a>）。账期必须随批次传递，且当账期已关闭时触发重开或调整分录。</p>\n<p><strong>声明与实算的原始值</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>d</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S_d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>a</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S_a</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 都必须被保存，而不仅是二者的差。理由是三个月后复盘时你需要重新解释一次差异，而那时的手续费口径或汇率可能已经变了——保存原始声明值与当时的实算值，是让复盘能用当时的语境而非今天的认知进行的唯一办法。这与本 hub 反复强调的可复现立场一致。</p>\n<p><strong>账期闭合</strong>是这条接口上的一个关键动作。闭合意味着该账期的所有批次都已到位且核对通过。闭合需要三项证据：期望清单全部到位（<a href=\"../file-ops-observability/missing-file-alert\">应到未到文件告警</a> 的完备性）、所有批次处于终态（无在途、无 <code>STALLED</code>）、所有未解释差额已清零或有明确的处置记录。把闭合做成一个<strong>有证据要求的显式动作</strong>，而不是时间到了就自动关闭，是防止「带着未知差额进入下一账期」的唯一办法。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>控制记录核对是内容与声明的交叉验证：字节哈希检传输损坏、总笔数检行数语义、总金额检业务口径、借贷平衡检方向。三者独立计算并交叉比对，不能互相替代。</li>\n<li>总金额必须<strong>按币种、方向、业务类型分组</strong>求和；跨币种或跨方向直接相加在数学上无意义，且会掩盖方向错误。</li>\n<li>借贷平衡 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>∑</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mtext>DBIT</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>∑</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mtext>CRDT</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sum a_{\\text{DBIT}} = \\sum a_{\\text{CRDT}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">DBIT</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">CRDT</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 比总额核对更强，因为它是会计恒等式在文件层的投影，无法被「两边同错」通过。</li>\n<li>舍入差是必然而非异常，容差应按 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n \\cdot \\delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4445em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span></span></span></span></span> 建模并写明推导依据；<strong>任何超过容差的差额必须拆解归因，绝不通过放大容差掩盖</strong>。</li>\n<li>差额必须拆为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>D</mi><mtext>quarantine</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>D</mi><mtext>round</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>D</mi><mtext>dup</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>D</mi><mtext>other</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D_{\\text{quarantine}} + D_{\\text{round}} + D_{\\text{dup}} + D_{\\text{other}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">quarantine</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">round</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">dup</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">other</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>；只有未解释差额是真异常，且它的数值应当直接出现在告警措辞里。</li>\n<li>序号连续性检查能直接定位缺失区间，但必须在确认序号语义后作为配置项启用，否则假阳性。</li>\n<li>与对账中台的接口需传递批次可信度属性、账期归属、以及 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>d</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S_d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>a</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S_a</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的原始值；保存原始值是为了三个月后能用当时的语境而非今天的口径复盘。</li>\n<li>账期闭合是需要证据的显式动作（期望清单齐备 + 所有批次终态 + 未解释差额清零或已处置），不是时间到就自动关闭。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"校验和、总笔数与总额核对","id":"校验和-总笔数与总额核对"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"计算口径：分组是必须的","id":"计算口径-分组是必须的"},{"level":2,"text":"差额拆解：可解释与不可解释","id":"差额拆解-可解释与不可解释"},{"level":2,"text":"与对账中台的接口","id":"与对账中台的接口"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"错误文件隔离与告警","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/settlement-batch-file-exchange/file-parsing-validation/file-error-quarantine"},"next":{"title":"文件到发状态监控","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/settlement-batch-file-exchange/file-ops-observability/file-exchange-monitor"}}